-- WoW Forever NPC and object templates from official-server sniffs (beta builds 70245-70425).
-- Data source: Azeroth project, Sakhwoow/WoWForever (GPL-2), files 2026_10_20_00_world_forever_actual_sniff_01/02 and paladin sniff 02.
-- Covers the 16 NPCs (with their model) and 122 objects that the old ported world files carried and that these sniffs also have.
-- Names: the sniffs were taken with a Russian client; NPC names and titles are the English ones from Wowhead Forever,
-- object names the usual English names of the same object kind (Mailbox, Subway Bench, ...). Three objects whose English name
-- we could not confirm are left out (386691, 660964, 696211).
-- Safe to run again.
-- 0.1.28: left out where our own newer data owns the NPC (the sniff value would undo it):
--   Eldrun Stormbreaker 258098 (trainer flag, 2026_10_31_70), Veyric Thunderhame 259023 (quest giver + SmartAI),
--   Garen Largo 260093 (trainer flag), Highland Spider 260803 (hostile + SmartAI), Subdued Dragonspawn 271373 (kill
--   objective of quest 98297; sniff faction 35 makes it unattackable). The three unconfirmed objects (386691, 660964,
--   696211) are also taken out of the DELETE lists, so their existing rows stay.

